#: ../../source/isstream_README.md:9
msgid ""
"The missing `Stream.isStream(obj)`: determine if an object is standard "
"Node.js `Stream`. Works for Node-core `Stream` objects (for 0.8, 0.10, "
"0.11, and in theory, older and newer versions) and all versions of "
"**[readable-stream](https://github.com/isaacs/readable-stream)**."
msgstr ""

